            <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="Your contributions directly support initiatives that build peaceful communities and foster long-term stability under SDG Goal 16. Every donation funds grassroots educational workshops and conflict resolution training designed to prevent violence. Giving today is a direct investment in stronger institutions, justice, and a safer future for vulnerable populations. Thank you for partnering with us to create lasting positive change."/>
